# Sendora does not read environment variables.
# Leave this file as documentation. Do not put real passwords or API keys here.
#
# On first start the app creates data/mailing.sqlite, data/session.key, and data/mailbox.key.
# Those files stay on your computer. Do not commit the data/ directory.
#
# Optional AI drafting, if you turn it on, is saved in Settings inside the app.
# It is not an environment variable.
